<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia details May inflation figures.</title>
<headline>Indonesia details May inflation figures.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is an official breakdown of Indonesia's inflation in May:</p>
<p>			   May     April	May 96</p>
<p>    Month/month    +0.19     +0.56	 +0.06</p>
<p>    Year/year	+5.08     +4.95	 +7.52</p>
<p>CPI sectors (month/month)</p>
<p>    Food	     +0.30     +0.01</p>
<p>    Housing	  +0.22     +0.96</p>
<p>    Textiles	 +0.09     +0.07</p>
<p>    Services	 +0.08     +0.97</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
